1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
清晨五点的西湖，还没醒
Five a.m. at West Lake — not yet awake

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,000
雾在水上，桥在雾里
Mist on the water, a bridge in the mist

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,500
这是断桥，白娘子等许仙的地方
This is Broken Bridge, from the White Snake tale

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,000
九百年前，苏轼在这里当官
Nine centuries ago, Su Shi was posted here

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,500
他写：欲把西湖比西子
He wrote: compare West Lake to Xi Shi

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,000
淡妆浓抹，都好看
Plain or painted — always lovely

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,500
清晨的西湖，就是那抹淡妆
Dawn is her plainest, truest face

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,500
关注，带你去下一座城
Follow — I'll take you to the next city
